    "result_text": "There's only one test class, and the full build passes. \n\nDone. The change is implemented:\n\n1. **`Owner.java`** \u2014 added a derived `getOwnerSegment()` getter returning `<TIER>_<AREA>`:\n   - TIER = `PREMIUM` when `membershipLevel >= 3`, else `STANDARD`\n   - AREA = `METRO` when the locality is a known region (NSW/VIC/QLD, via the existing region table), else `REGIONAL`\n\n2. **`openapi.yml`** \u2014 added the `ownerSegment` string property to the owner schema so the generated `OwnerDto` carries the field and MapStruct maps it by name (same pattern as `locality`, `membershipLevel`, etc.).\n\nAll tests pass (`BUILD SUCCESS`), including both new acceptance cases: `STANDARD_METRO` for a Sydney/NSW owner and `STANDARD_REGIONAL` for an unknown-region owner.",
